{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DiAREzlnrW1795766165.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一艘由上環往深圳蛇口的客輪，在青衣油庫對出撞到船塢設施，22人受傷，其中5人情況嚴重。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208743-%E5%AE%A2%E8%BC%AA%E9%9D%92%E8%A1%A3%E5%B0%8D%E5%87%BA%E6%92%9E%E8%88%B9%E5%A1%A2%E8%A8%AD%E6%96%BD22%E4%BA%BA%E5%82%B7%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E6%83%85%E6%B3%81%E5%9A%B4%E9%87%8D%E8%88%B9%E9%A0%AD%E6%92%9E%E8%87%B3%E5%87%B9%E9%99%B7%E6%9C%89%E6%B2%B9%E6%BC%86%E5%89%9D%E8%90%BD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>客輪青衣對出撞船塢設施22人傷部分情況嚴重　船頭撞至凹陷有油漆剝落</strong></a><strong> </strong></p><p></p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案，控方結案陳詞，指蔡天鳳被殺是有預謀，包括事前租用龍尾村單位及購買物品，被告以種花、裝修等做藉口，全屬荒謬；又形容鄺家多年來如同「吸血鬼」，依賴蔡天鳳金錢過舒適生活長達14年。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208744-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E6%8E%A7%E6%96%B9%E7%B5%90%E6%A1%88%E9%99%B3%E8%A9%9E%E6%8C%87%E4%B8%89%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%97%A9%E6%9C%89%E9%A0%90%E8%AC%80%E5%BD%A2%E5%AE%B9%E9%84%BA%E5%AE%B6%E5%A4%9A%E5%B9%B4%E4%BE%86%E5%A6%82%E5%90%B8%E8%A1%80%E9%AC%BC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜控方結案陳詞指三被告早有預謀　形容鄺家多年來如「吸血鬼」</strong></a></p><p></p><p>中九龍繞道九龍灣段下月六日早上開通，標誌6號幹線全線貫通，屆時隧道劃一收費8元。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208742-%E4%B8%AD%E4%B9%9D%E9%BE%8D%E7%B9%9E%E9%81%93%E4%B9%9D%E9%BE%8D%E7%81%A3%E6%AE%B5126%E9%80%9A%E8%BB%8A%E8%88%87%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0%E6%AE%B5%E5%8F%8A%E5%B0%87%E8%97%8D%E9%9A%A7%E9%81%93%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%B5%84%E6%88%906%E8%99%9F%E5%B9%B9%E7%B7%9A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>中九龍繞道｜九龍灣段12.6通車　與油麻地段及將藍隧道共同組成6號幹線</strong></a></p><p></p><p>接連有機構及商戶遭黑客攻擊，更利用盜取的個人資料精準詐騙。警方審視部分個案，發現不少涉及應用程式介面漏洞。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208745-%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%A3%E6%9C%89%E6%A9%9F%E6%A7%8B%E5%8F%8A%E5%95%86%E6%88%B6%E9%81%AD%E9%BB%91%E5%AE%A2%E6%94%BB%E6%93%8A%E8%AD%A6%E6%96%B9%E6%8C%87%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%80%8B%E6%A1%88%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E6%87%89%E7%94%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%8B%E9%9D%A2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>接連有機構及商戶遭黑客攻擊　警方指部分個案涉及應用程式介面漏洞</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:23:55.547486+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":394,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:37:24.253726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:17:16.437747+00:00","content_hash":"332bbbe1ffe793977e4b85a089f0987b592c4936d4a1610b1f1cd70dbc51d00d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:23:55.547486+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}